I think the transport never rekeys here. The loop stops at 100 actions, so a stream holds fewer than 100 packets, and the transport rekeys every 224:
https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/a773e1e33b349dc819b5a0edc1c7a4839dc73b48/src/bip324.h#L26

Maybe add an action that appends a run of empty decoys? With the diff below, libFuzzer's coverage report shows this rekey branch hit:
https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/a773e1e33b349dc819b5a0edc1c7a4839dc73b48/src/crypto/chacha20poly1305.cpp#L106-L108


